// exchange and at most one Release in its lifetime, so the messages in transit
// are recorded per order:
//   req: 'none' | 'Reserve' (order -> inventory) | 'Reserved' | 'OutOfStock' (inventory -> order)
//   rel: 0 | qty  (a Release { qty } in transit, order -> inventory)
// Delivering a message is one action per message kind, for any order, in any
// interleaving — the checker explores every delivery order.

